<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs fell 1.4 pct Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs fell 1.4 pct Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs fell 1.4 percent to 64.6 million tonnes in the first nine months of 1995, trade body Unione Petrolifera said.</p>
<p>Crude refinery runs rose 2.1 percent over the period, while imported semi-finished products fell 27.5 percent.</p>
</text>
